      "content": "Thanks, that's clear. I'm seeing some weirdness in the vertical profiles, though. Some of the salinity readings are jumping around quite erratically at certain depths, which doesn't seem to correlate with the temperature shifts. What would typically cause those kinds of sudden, non-linear spikes in the data?",
